---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const links = [
	{ href: "/track-record", label: "Track Record" },
	{ href: "/research", label: "Research" },
	{ href: "/now", label: "Now" },
	{ href: "/contact", label: "Contact" },
];
---

<Layout>
	<p class="hero">
		Trained to be a physician. Spend my time building &amp; investing in
		AI, healthcare, &amp; life sciences.
	</p>
	<p>
		I recently co-founded ChartR, a company building long-horizon
		reinforcement learning environments for clinical AI &amp; automating
		front- &amp; back-office workflows in enterprise healthcare. Before
		that, I evaluated thousands of early-stage start-ups, &amp; helped
		grow a digital health platform from the ground-up. Alongside that,
		I'm a physician and researcher — completing my preliminary residency
		at Mount Sinai Elmhurst before dermatology training at the University
		of Maryland, with 40+ peer-reviewed papers in clinical AI &amp;
		dermatology along the way. I completed my MD, MBA at Columbia
		University in NYC.
	</p>
	<p>
		I'm always glad to connect — reach out via{" "}
		<a href="/contact">Contact</a>.
	</p>

	<div class="links">
		{links.map((l) => <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}
	</div>
</Layout>
